            <p rend="justify">Waiting for the flashlight.</p>
            <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
            <p rend="justify">STUDIES IN EXPRESSION</p>
            <p rend="justify">Making it a jack pot.</p>
            <p rend="justify">[Image unavailable.]</p>
